@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam defaultFontColor #172033
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam titleFontSize 20
skinparam ArrowFontSize 14
skinparam noteFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
title Execution outcomes and blocked prerequisites
state "NOT EXECUTED" as Pending
state "BLOCKED" as Blocked
state "PASS" as Pass
state "FAIL" as Fail
[*] --> Pending
Pending --> Blocked : required prerequisite unavailable
Blocked --> Pending : prerequisite restored
Pending --> Pass : expected behavior observed
Pending --> Fail : expected behavior violated
Fail --> Pass : correction and fresh retest pass
note bottom of Pass : Specification or code change alone does not establish PASS
@enduml
